   "subject": "Re: 請問如何畫出二元常態分配的立體圖形",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Please try:</div><div> </div><div># bivariate normal distribution plot<br>library(MASS)<br>Sigma &lt;- matrix(c(1, 0.5, 0.5, 1), 2)<br>bivnorm &lt;- mvrnorm(n=1000, rep(0, 2), Sigma)<br>bivnorm.kde &lt;- kde2d(bivnorm[,1], bivnorm[,2], n=50)<br>persp(bivnorm.kde, phi=45, theta=40, shade=0.1, main=&quot;bivariate normal distribution plot&quot;)<br>image(bivnorm.kde, main=&quot;contour plot for bivariate normal distribution&quot;)<br>contour(bivn.kde, add=TRUE)<br># end</div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a style=\"margin-right:1em;margin-left:1em\" href=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-nIcKDLmYdxI/UlwPSW4u39I/AAAAAAAAAnA/XL0i44i_TmY/s1600/bivnorm-3dplot.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-nIcKDLmYdxI/UlwPSW4u39I/AAAAAAAAAnA/XL0i44i_TmY/s1600/bivnorm-3dplot.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238753413000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2d0lHB9fn2117zKWuMprGx\"><img width=\"303\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://lh4.googleusercontent.com/-nIcKDLmYdxI/UlwPSW4u39I/AAAAAAAAAnA/XL0i44i_TmY/s320/bivnorm-3dplot.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a style=\"margin-right:1em;margin-left:1em\" href=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-rMePQNzpxKM/UlwPYxvlgEI/AAAAAAAAAnI/dEgJAkYgEWM/s1600/bivnorm-contour.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-rMePQNzpxKM/UlwPYxvlgEI/AAAAAAAAAnI/dEgJAkYgEWM/s1600/bivnorm-contour.png&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793238753413000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1lFY0xbhig4BtjSaJfLc6N\"><img width=\"320\" height=\"268\" src=\"https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-rMePQNzpxKM/UlwPYxvlgEI/AAAAAAAAAnI/dEgJAkYgEWM/s320/bivnorm-contour.png\" border=\"0\"></a></p><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;display:inline!important;white-space:norm